{"parse": {"title": "TLD-04", "pageid": 23050, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TLD-03\" title=\"TLD-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TLD-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/TLD-05\" title=\"TLD-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TLD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.85.92.E6.9D.AF.E7.9A.84.E6.81.A9.E5.85.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"酒杯的恩典\">酒杯的恩典</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 酒杯的恩典</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Grace of the Goblet</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>慈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>地<span class=\"color-value\"></span>普<span class=\"color-value\"></span>照<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190304</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>大人，我们真要这么做吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乔治紧张地四处张望，怀里紧紧地揣着一只精致的玻璃瓶，绯红的液体在里面晃荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>如这儿的修士所言，适量饮酒是被允许的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>喝醉了也算适量吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>很遗憾，关于这一标准的解释权并不在你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>万一……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>明白！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方一溜烟地跑进了那个玻璃彩窗交错的房间里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前来祷告的信徒们悉数离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乔治慢腾腾地挪了过去，在神父的桌前俯首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>老爷，我希望得到主的原谅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>我是有罪之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>你能来到这儿，正说明你所受的感化。坦言罢，仁慈的主会宽恕你的罪行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神父慈爱地望着这个不着调的信徒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后，他轻咳了两声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>你带回了属于主的牛羊吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>我没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>慈爱的光褪去了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>那金黄的麦穗呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>也没有，老爷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神父的慈爱悄无声息地消逝了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>看来你仍没有悔恨……<br />放下你的自私，主所赐与你的，必定会远远胜过你在人间所付出的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>我带来了这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乔治撩起衣袍，露出了玻璃瓶的一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>老爷，请您闻闻它的香气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那束仁慈的光又回到了神父的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>噢～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>它的气息如此芬芳，如同福音降世，撒播人间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>现在，我能感受到你的真诚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>回去吧，你的罪责被一笔勾销了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-561001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乔治：</div><div>谢谢您，马拉基大人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哐——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>木塞被轻轻地撬开，某种实在的幸福充盈了这片空间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>满身酒气的马拉基神父走过空无一人的长廊，醉倒在大理石圣像前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的步伐踉踉跄跄，丝毫没注意到站在阴影处的帕米埃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>主啊！请原谅我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>嗝——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>只喝了一点点……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>喝醉……我并没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你看起来很忠诚，马拉基神父。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕米埃适时地出现了，她倚靠在天使像上，手里握着赤色的焰形剑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如正午刺目的阳光，又如天国泯灭前奔涌的火舌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>您，您怎么会在这？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你在祈祷原谅，先生。我和你一样，我在祈祷真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>我找到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>看来，饱受醉酒之苦的，并不是只有切塞纳修士一个人，是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>那家伙……不是我干的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>是他自己不小心掉下去，不、不是我害的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>当然，我相信你们的饮酒行为只是出于纯粹的友谊，而非别的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>你们分享福音，分享美酒，甚至包括尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕米埃的影子又走近了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>呸……那些尸体跟我一点儿干系都没有！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>如果不是那些脏兮兮的尸体，院长才不会让我们排挤他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>他，他就像个肮脏的粪金龟……还有让人倒胃口的巫师味道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>你可以去地下室看看，那儿能证实我的说法……我没做错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>但愿如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他靠在神像上，视线游离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>大瘟疫已经过去很久了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>只要什么都不做，人们就会忘记那些糟糕的事，他们会继续相信我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>……这便是他的罪名么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>一个企图研究尸体、唤醒人们痛苦记忆的出格巫师？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>当，当然！只要时间过得够久，我们就能重新成为人们所笃信的存在，他们会捐赠更多的物资……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>可现在呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马拉基：</div><div>请宽恕我……慈爱的主啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>马拉基的胡言乱语和满身的酒精味混在一起，像是一片泥泞的沼泽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他似乎并未理解自己在说些什么，直到最后瘫倒在地，他都一直在喃喃自语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>他也许会听见你的祷告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>也许会宽恕你的罪行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-302201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕米埃：</div><div>但，不是现在。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TLD-04"}}